L82:  Nonjudgement (C) Introduction of body scanning
L83:  Explanation of a body scanning exercise Group discussion (D) Discussion of homework (IV) Session 4
L84:  (A) Warm-up: 5 min mindful breathing exercise (B) Introduction of the components of mindfulness
L85:  Acceptance (C) Introduction of mindful yoga
L86:  Explanation of a mindful yoga exercise Group discussion (D) Discussion of homework (V) Session 5
L87:  (A) Warm-up: 5 min mindful breathing exercise (B) Introduction of the components of mindfulness
L88:  Curiosity (C) Introduction of mindful walking
L89:  Explanation of a mindful walking exercise Group discussion (D) Discussion of homework (VI) Session 6
L90:  (A) Warm-up: 5 min mindful breathing exercise (B) How is mindfulness applied to sport?
L91:  Mindful breathing before a competition Being mindful of perceptions of stress (C) Performance of a mindfulness meditation exercise (D) Group discussion and homework (VII) Session 7
L92:  (A) Warm-up: 5 min mindful breathing exercise (B) How is mindfulness applied to sport
L93:  Self-awareness before a competition (C) Performance of a body scanning exercise (D) Group discussion and homework (VIII) Session 8
L94:  (A) Warm-up: 5 min mindful breathing exercise (B) How is mindfulness applied to sport
